sections.append('<h3>Structural feedstock calculation</h3><p>Net CAD mass ÷ stock utilization × budget $/kg ÷ 1000. Rates are assumptions, not market quotes. Gearheads, coil, motor/IC package composites and capacitor are excluded rather than priced as solid steel or plastic. These rows are already contained in fabricated-part allowances above; do not add them twice.</p>'+table(['Material','Net g','Stock g','Utilization','Budget $/kg','$/bot'],[(h(a['material']),f"{a['modeled_net_g']:.4f}",f"{a['stock_allowance_g']:.4f}",f"{100*a['stock_utilization']:.0f}%",f"{a['low_USD_kg']}–{a['high_USD_kg']}",money(a['low'])+'–'+money(a['high'])) for a in raw]))
